          <div class="gfav ${isFav?'on':''}" onclick="event.stopPropagation();Hub.toggleFav('${g.id}',this)">${isFav?'❤️':'🤍'}</div>
          ${live?`<div class="gcard-live"><span class="dot" style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#7cffcf;animation:blk 1.2s infinite"></span>${esc(ID.partnerName)} is playing</div>`:''}
          ${partnerPresence.online && !challenged?`<button class="gchallenge" onclick="event.stopPropagation();Hub.challengeGame('${g.id}')">⬝ Challenge</button>`:''}
        </div>
        <div class="gcard-body">
          <div class="gcard-title">${g.title}</div>
          <div class="gcard-desc">${g.desc}</div>
          <div class="gcard-meta">${g.tags.map(t=>`<span class="gtag">${t}</span>`).join('')}</div>
          <button class="gplay-btn" style="background:${g.grad}">${hist?'▶ Continue':'▶ Play Now'}</button>
        </div>
      </div>`;
```
> Also, when a request comes IN (partner challenged us), we should show "Waiting…" on THAT game card instead of "Challenge". The `challenged` var above only hides our own outgoing challenge. To mark the partner's pending game, rely on `greq-card` on the hub — enough for the accept/decline flow.

